# Deterministic SVG for the checked LA20 fixture.
def u:attention_svg() { "Render score, row-softmax, and value-mixing flow."; "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1080 520\" role=\"img\"><title>Single-head attention turns query-key scores into normalized value mixtures</title><desc>Two queries score three keys, each softmax row sums to one, and the weights mix three value rows into two outputs. Batch and head axes are outside this rank-two lesson.</desc><style>text{font-family:monospace;fill:#c0caf5}.p{fill:#24283b;stroke:#414868;stroke-width:2}.q{fill:#7aa2f7}.k{fill:#9ece6a}.s{fill:#e0af68}.w{fill:#f7768e}.v{fill:#bb9af7}.big{font-size:21px}.small{font-size:15px}</style><rect width=\"1080\" height=\"520\" fill=\"#1a1b26\"/><text class=\"big\" x=\"30\" y=\"34\">softmax(Q @ K^T / sqrt(2)) @ V</text><rect class=\"p\" x=\"25\" y=\"65\" width=\"180\" height=\"170\"/><text x=\"45\" y=\"95\">Q [2 queries,2]</text><rect class=\"q\" x=\"55\" y=\"120\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2 x 2</text><text class=\"big\" x=\"215\" y=\"160\">@</text><rect class=\"p\" x=\"250\" y=\"65\" width=\"180\" height=\"170\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"95\">K^T [2,3 keys]</text><rect class=\"k\" x=\"280\" y=\"120\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2 x 3</text><text class=\"big\" x=\"440\" y=\"160\">=</text><rect class=\"p\" x=\"475\" y=\"65\" width=\"260\" height=\"170\"/><text x=\"495\" y=\"95\">scores / sqrt(2) [2,3]</text><rect class=\"s\" x=\"510\" y=\"120\" width=\"190\" height=\"80\"/><text x=\"605\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"middle\">[.707,0,.707]</text><text x=\"605\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\">[0,.707,.707]</text><text class=\"big\" x=\"750\" y=\"160\">softmax</text><rect class=\"p\" x=\"870\" y=\"65\" width=\"185\" height=\"170\"/><text x=\"890\" y=\"95\">weights [2,3]</text><rect class=\"w\" x=\"900\" y=\"120\" width=\"125\" height=\"80\"/><text x=\"962\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"middle\">each row</text><text x=\"962\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\">sums to 1</text><path stroke=\"#c0caf5\" stroke-width=\"3\" d=\"M540 280H830\"/><text x=\"685\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">weights [query,key] @ V [key,value]</text><rect class=\"p\" x=\"230\" y=\"315\" width=\"260\" height=\"145\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"345\">V [3 keys,2 values]</text><rect class=\"v\" x=\"280\" y=\"365\" width=\"160\" height=\"65\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"403\" text-anchor=\"middle\">[[10,0],[0,10],[5,5]]</text><text class=\"big\" x=\"510\" y=\"395\">=</text><rect class=\"p\" x=\"555\" y=\"315\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"/><text x=\"575\" y=\"345\">output [2 queries,2 values]</text><rect class=\"q\" x=\"600\" y=\"365\" width=\"210\" height=\"65\"/><text x=\"705\" y=\"403\" text-anchor=\"middle\">[6.02,3.98] / [3.98,6.02]</text><text class=\"small\" x=\"540\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\">rank-2 single head only; B1 blocks batch and head axes</text></svg>\n" }
